/E (As part of the iterative design process recommended by Fullerton \(2018, p. 248\), the group conducted a structured playtest session with three peers prior to finalising the development build. Participants were asked to play the game without instruction and to verbalise their experience \(think-aloud protocol\). Findings were recorded, categorised by frequency and severity, and used directly to inform design refinements.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
