345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (Systems communicate through C# System.Action delegates rather than direct method calls. GameManager subscribes to backstoryCard.OnDismissed, consequenceCard.OnComplete, bribeListManager.OnDismissed, and dayTimer.OnTimerExpired. This decouples systems so that any component can be modified or replaced without breaking the others \(Freeman & Freeman, 2020, p. 66\).)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
